<title>INDIA: India's BHEL 96/97 net 4.68 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India's BHEL 96/97 net 4.68 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit (billion rupees)     4.68 vs     3.50</p>
<p>    Shr (rupees)			 19.21 vs    14.31</p>
<p>    Profit before tax (billions)    8.48 vs     5.82</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		57.40 vs    48.33</p>
<p>NOTE: Bharat Heavy Electricals Ltd, a state-owned manufacturer of electrical machinery and power equipments, released the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
